{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Girl In White&quot; is an emotive story focusing on youthful, high-school love and those wistful, almost fantastical feelings that everyone has experienced at least once.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/4957e5f8b8554b156856fe790a7d1b56.avif?t=1761353852\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, a high school senior, accidentally discovers the existence of the <strong>Dream Corridor</strong>\u2014a realm that bridges the living and the dead. Within it lies an endless hallway lined with doors, each one connecting distant corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is why, in dreams, we find ourselves transported across vast distances in the blink of an eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the discovery comes with an unintended side effect: Long gains the ability to see wandering spirits. What seems like a miracle at first quickly reveals itself to be more of a nightmare, as he realizes that restless <strong>Ghosts</strong> have always <strong>Surrounded Us</strong>\u2014unseen, until now...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/0d187cc77091cee6be571c939f5b93b7.avif?t=1761353852\" width=251 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just your typical story-driven game,</strong> this is where action meets introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond battling wandering spirits in the mortal realm, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that reveal hidden sides of your personality\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school turn-based dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre personality quizzes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot shiny stuff, equip questionable gear</strong>, and go toe-to-toe with a terrifying cast of shadowy spirit-things</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4108010?t=1761353852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/852fb0316622ab306d8f66cca660773346ab91ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761353852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/a0b314b7884d827c1920322183af54e50d6eec82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761353852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/a0b314b7884d827c1920322183af54e50d6eec82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761353852","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;The Girl In White&quot; is an emotive story focusing on youthful, high-school love and those wistful, almost fantastical feelings that everyone has experienced at least once.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/4957e5f8b8554b156856fe790a7d1b56.avif?t=1761353852\" width=600 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long, a high school senior, accidentally discovers the existence of the <strong>Dream Corridor</strong>\u2014a realm that bridges the living and the dead. Within it lies an endless hallway lined with doors, each one connecting distant corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is why, in dreams, we find ourselves transported across vast distances in the blink of an eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the discovery comes with an unintended side effect: Long gains the ability to see wandering spirits. What seems like a miracle at first quickly reveals itself to be more of a nightmare, as he realizes that restless <strong>Ghosts</strong> have always <strong>Surrounded Us</strong>\u2014unseen, until now...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/extras/0d187cc77091cee6be571c939f5b93b7.avif?t=1761353852\" width=251 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than just your typical story-driven game,</strong> this is where action meets introspection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond battling wandering spirits in the mortal realm, you\u2019ll also be answering delightfully absurd quizzes that reveal hidden sides of your personality\u2014even the ones you didn\u2019t know existed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school turn-based dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre personality quizzes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot shiny stuff, equip questionable gear</strong>, and go toe-to-toe with a terrifying cast of shadowy spirit-things</p></li></ul>","developers":["Succubella Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4108010/627e3fe9415f947ce60ac0da389dfad76dd4e59a/header.jpg?t=1761353852","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Succubella Games, All Rights Reserved.","linux_requireme